   "body": "Shipped in v0.1.2673 (fa6725ee7), using @skygunner's patch from their branch plus the provider name. Thanks @zane668.\n\n- An account the Grok plugin reports no plan for now says **Grok**, not \"SuperGrok\". A plan that is reported is still shown as given.\n- The provider row and the Add tile are named \"Grok\" instead of \"Grok (SuperGrok)\".\n\nStill open: the plugin doesn't report a plan at all yet, so the real tier (SuperGrok, X Premium+, free) can't be shown until the plugin can read it from Grok. I haven't tried this with a real Grok account on this build.\n",
